graph TD
    %% Styling for Research Quality
    classDef entity fill:#e1f5fe,stroke:#01579b,stroke-width:2px,color:#000;
    classDef system fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#e65100,stroke-width:3px,color:#000,font-weight:bold;
    
    %% Nodes
    Student[Student]:::entity
    Counselor[Counselor]:::entity
    Admin[Admin]:::entity
    GCMS((Guidance Counseling<br>Management System)):::system

    %% Data Flow - Student
    Student -->|1. Login / Registration| GCMS
    Student -->|2. Appointment Request & Wellness Data| GCMS
    GCMS -->|3. Appointment Confirmation & Notifications| Student

    %% Data Flow - Counselor
    Counselor -->|4. Login| GCMS
    Counselor -->|5. Session Notes & Status Updates| GCMS
    GCMS -->|6. Schedule & Student Records| Counselor

    %% Data Flow - Admin
    Admin -->|7. Login| GCMS
    Admin -->|8. Manage Accounts| GCMS
    GCMS -->|9. System Reports & User Lists| Admin

    %% Layout Hints
    Student ~~~ GCMS
    Counselor ~~~ GCMS
    Admin ~~~ GCMS